gfs2: Remove the glock lru list and shrinker

jira KERNEL-1940
Rebuild_History Non-Buildable kernel-4.18.0-553.187.1.el8_10
commit-author Andreas Gruenbacher <agruenba@redhat.com>
commit da26828b82a450f462bacbd51b10d1f71ee92630
Empty-Commit: Cherry-Pick Conflicts during history rebuild.
Will be included in final tarball splat. Ref for failed cherry-pick at:
ciq/ciq_backports/kernel-4.18.0-553.187.1.el8_10/da26828b.failed

We are no longer keeping unreferences glocks around, so remove the
now-obsolete glock lru list and shrinker.

	Signed-off-by: Andreas Gruenbacher <agruenba@redhat.com>
(cherry picked from commit da26828b82a450f462bacbd51b10d1f71ee92630)
	Signed-off-by: Jonathan Maple <jmaple@ciq.com>

